            "patch": {
                "description": "Change a existing user's info in the system.\n### Logic of the request body fields (Tree-state logic):\n1. **Field is missing**: `phone_number` is ignored, value in the database won't change.\n2. **Field value is specified**: `\"phone_number\": \"+79998887766\"` new value will be saved to the database.\n3. **Field value is null**: `\"phone_number\": null` current value in the database will be removed (set to NULL).\n4. Restrictions: `full_name` can't be set to null",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "users"
                ],
                "summary": "Change user",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "description": "ID of the user to change",
                        "name": "id",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true
